  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Problem: The recent survey situation has shown a lack of public notice of official surveys and willingness to engage with surveys outside of vrchat.  The last survey only had a potential 1% participation from the active vrchat population.\n\nSolution: Enable news, notification and surveys to be read and completed in game, my recommendation is to create an official town hall style world where you can include latest news, help advice, and surveys that can be completed by each active account once by visiting the world.  You can also include on the wall your dev streams and other official streams so people can watch in game.\n\nI know there is the hub world but that has a more fun theme than official stance you want to go for.\n\nIts a small change but one I feel can help the game, players and the devs.",
